--   **Memory Complexity:** $O(\text{volume\_size})$ for the 2D texture storage. The 2D texture size is $\lceil\sqrt{N}\rceil \times \lceil\sqrt{N}\rceil \times \text{slice\_resolution}^2$ for $N$ slices.
